    LLM: 'Game: Kaluki (South Africa). Type: Contract Rummy. Deck: 2x52+4 Jokers (108 cards). Hand: 13 cards. 7 rounds with varying meld requirements. Jokers wild (50 penalty if held). Black Aces=15, Red Aces=1. Goal: Lowest score after 7 rounds.',
    Player: 'Welcome to South African Kaluki! Watch out for those Jokersâ€”50 penalty points each! Can you manage your risk across 7 rounds and finish with the lowest score?',
    objective: "Be the first to 'Go Out' by melding all cards. The player with the lowest score after 7 rounds is the champion.",
    gameplay: '1. **Drawing**: Each turn, draw either the top card of the stock or the top discard. 2. **Melding**: Form sets (3-4 cards same rank) and runs (3+ consecutive same suit). 3. **Initial Meld**: Must meet round-specific point requirements. 4. **Discarding**: End turn by discarding one card.',
